+// -Dmc.asyncEntityTextures=true, default off): getTexture() of a texture that is not registered yet first asks the
+// EntityTexturePrefetch for contents decoded on a background thread from the same resource manager, and applies them
+// exactly as registerAndLoad applies synchronously loaded contents; when there are none it loads synchronously as
+// vanilla. reload() invalidates the prefetch at its start and restarts it once the textures are applied; close() frees it.
+// With the switch off (prefetch == null) every method is vanilla's.
